        <h3>How many feet in a meter?</h3>
        <p>1 meter = 3.28084 feet. To convert meters to feet, multiply by 3.28084. So 2 m = 6.562 ft, 5 m = 16.404 ft, 10 m = 32.808 ft.</p>
